":"I was doing 10 mph","chinese":"我正以每小时10英里的速度行进"}]},{"id":"do:o:594489649525","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"走完…的距离","glossesEn":["cover distance of"],"examples":[{"english":"we've done 30 km since lunch","chinese":"午饭后我们已走了30公里路"}]},{"id":"do:o:c08129f5b88d","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"游览","glossesEn":["tour"],"registers":["informal"],"examples":[{"english":"to do Venice","chinese":"游览威尼斯"}]},{"id":"do:o:3838e4d28489","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"适合","glossesEn":["fill needs of"],"registers":["informal"],"examples":[{"english":"will this pen do you?","chinese":"这支笔你用得上吗？"}]},{"id":"do:o:d5fe24cb7792","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"欺骗","glossesEn":["cheat"],"registers":["informal"],"examples":[{"english":"to do sb out of sth","chinese":"从某人处骗走"},{"english":"I've been done out of £20","chinese":"我被骗走了20英镑"},{"english":"we've been done","chinese":"我们上当了"}]},{"id":"do:o:116373d43837","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"骟","glossesEn":["sterilize"],"registers":["informal"],"examples":[{"english":"to get the cat/dog done","chinese":"骟猫/骟狗"}]},{"id":"do:o:5116912a9a40","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"抢劫","glossesEn":["rob"],"registers":["informal"],"examples":[{"english":"to do a bank","chinese":"抢银行"}]},{"id":"do:o:e69033d0459e","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"宣判…有罪","glossesEn":["convict"],"registers":["informal"],"examples":[{"english":"to get done for sth","chinese":"因…被判有罪"}]},{"id":"do:o:976b0e486e5c","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"做","glossesEn":["behave"],"examples":[{"english":"do as I do","chinese":"照着我的样子做"},{"english":"well done!","chinese":"干得好！"},{"english":"do unto others as you would have them do unto you","chinese":"己所不欲，勿施于人"}]},{"id":"do:o:d38e9cc60df6","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"合适","glossesEn":["be right"],"examples":[{"english":"that box will do","chinese":"那个盒子能行"},{"english":"these trousers will do for gardening","chinese":"这条裤子可以穿来侍弄花园"},{"english":"this (really) won't do!","chinese":"这（真的）不行！"}]},{"id":"do:o:6de659d0f016","label":"vi.","definitionZh":